\paragraph{Statement recorded in the supplied source.}
For an observed smooth dynamical system whose local observability Gramian is uniformly positive definite and bounded, is the system globally observable on [0,T] whenever the Gramian-induced state-space Riemannian manifold is geodesically complete and has uniformly negative curvature? \href{https://doi.org/10.4171/owr/2009/11}{[S2]}
